  "body": "There's something special about finding a home that ticks all the boxes, especially when the beach, everyday convenience and a relaxed coastal lifestyle are right on your doorstep. Welcome to 70 Bay Street, Red Beach, a beautifully presented home in a sought-after Hibiscus Coast location. With its welcoming feel, practical living spaces and fantastic outdoor areas, this is a property that makes it easy to imagine settling in and making it your own.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned to enjoy the best of Red Beach, this is a home where family life and entertaining go hand in hand. Whether you're enjoying a quiet morning coffee in the sunshine, hosting friends for a weekend barbecue or heading down to the beach for a stroll, there's plenty here to love.\r\n\r\nWhat's To Love:\r\n- Three double bedrooms, including a master with ensuite.\r\n- Two bathrooms for added convenience, with an additional toilet downstairs\r\n- Spacious kitchen, dining and living areas.\r\n- Light-filled interiors with a welcoming feel.\r\n- Sunny patio, established gardens and manicured lawns.\r\n- Double internal-access garage with handy attic storage.\r\n- Separate shed and additional space for a small boat, camper or trailer.\r\n- Short stroll to Red Beach.\r\n- Close to local shops, cafes and everyday amenities.\r\n- Convenient access to nearby schools, public transport and the wider Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\nBeyond the front gate, Red Beach offers the kind of lifestyle that's hard to beat. Spend your weekends at the beach, enjoy a barbecue with friends or explore the many parks, shops and recreational facilities nearby. It's a location that strikes a wonderful balance between a relaxed seaside atmosphere and the convenience of everyday living.\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for a home that combines space, sunshine, excellent parking and a fantastic coastal location, 70 Bay Street deserves your attention. Homes offering this appealing combination are always worth a closer look, so don't miss your opportunity to discover the lifestyle on offer here.\r\n\r\nCome along and see for yourself - your Red Beach lifestyle awaits! Give Nicole Donovan a call today to view!\r\n\r\nAuction: 4:00pm, Thursday 19 November 2026 In Rooms, Ray White Orewa (unless sold prior). You can watch the auction live here: https://rwcarpenterrealty.co.nz/watch-our-auctions-live",
